bash\n-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n```\nOptimize for performance (`-O3`, strip debug symbols). This is the production build type.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- Install binaries to `/usr`\n- Install libraries to `/usr/lib` (important on multi-lib systems to avoid `/usr/lib64` confusion)\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx"}